@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
hide footbox

participant ":MainWindow" as Window UI_COLOR
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "c:ViewCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":PersonListPanel" as List UI_COLOR
participant ":DetailPane" as Detail UI_COLOR

[-> Window : executeCommand("view 1")
activate Window
Window -> Logic : execute("view 1")
activate Logic
ref over Logic, Command
AddressBookParser / ViewCommandParser parse the input,
validate index 1 and construct c:ViewCommand.
end ref
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
activate Model
Model --> Command : lastShownList
deactivate Model
note right of Command
Validate the index against lastShownList.size().
Read the first client's name; do not change data.
end note
Command --> Logic : result: CommandResult(feedback, index)
deactivate Command
ref over Logic, Model
Shared save path: saveAddressBook(model.getAddressBook()).
Continue only if saving succeeds.
end ref
Logic --> Window : result
deactivate Logic
note over Window : Read result.getViewIndex().
Window -> List : selectPerson(index)
activate List
List -> List : Select via ListView selection model
List -> Window : selectedPersonProperty listener\n(observable, oldPerson, newPerson)
activate Window
Window -> Detail : setPerson(newPerson)
activate Detail
note right of Detail
Render profile, hide empty optional rows,
and reset the panel's scroll position.
A null selection shows the empty state.
end note
Detail --> Window
deactivate Detail
Window --> List
deactivate Window
List -> List : Scroll ListView to index
List --> Window
deactivate List
note over Window
Display result feedback (abbreviated).
end note
[<-- Window : result
deactivate Window
@enduml
